flowchart TD
  A["Entry points<br/>Lessons list, Calendar button or empty slot,<br/>course page, Dashboard, Duplicate,<br/>Schedule a replacement"] --> B["LW-1 Course and students<br/>agencies also choose the tutor"]
  B -->|"no courses"| B1["You need a course first<br/>link to New course"]
  B --> C["LW-2 Topic and time<br/>topic from course plan, date, time, length,<br/>repeat, timezone"]
  C -->|"validation"| C1["Add a lesson topic<br/>Choose a time in the future<br/>Lesson must end after it starts"]
  C1 --> C
  C -->|"clash with tutor or student"| C2["Non-blocking warning"]
  C2 --> D
  C --> D["LW-3 Review and schedule"]
  D -->|"Schedule lesson or N lessons"| E{"Saved?"}
  E -->|"fails"| E1["We couldn't schedule the lesson<br/>Nothing was saved. Try again"]
  E1 --> D
  E -->|"yes"| F["LP-01 Lesson page, status Planned"]
  F --> G["Students notified NTF-201<br/>one email per series, own join link"]
  F --> H["LP-05 Join links<br/>Copy, WhatsApp, Email,<br/>Get a new link, Remove from this lesson"]
  F --> I{"Change of plan?"}
  I -->|"Reschedule LP-03"| J["Pick new time or drag on calendar<br/>or press M with keyboard"]
  J --> J1["Toast: Lesson moved, Undo<br/>emails held until undo window closes"]
  J1 -->|"Undo"| J2["Nothing is sent"]
  J1 -->|"window closes"| J3["NTF-202 sent<br/>no-email students: Send on WhatsApp or Copy message"]
  I -->|"Cancel LP-04"| K["Per-student wording, optional message,<br/>this lesson or this and following"]
  K --> K1["Toast: Lesson cancelled, Undo for 5 minutes"]
  K1 -->|"Undo"| K2["Back to Planned, no email"]
  K1 -->|"window closes"| K3["NTF-204 sent, join links die"]
  I -->|"Duplicate"| A
  F --> L["Reminders NTF-207 and NTF-208<br/>30 minutes before, 24 hours optional"]
  L -->|"booked or moved less than 30 min ahead"| L1["No reminder, the join-link email is enough"]
  F --> M["Notes and Lesson plan tabs<br/>Draft lesson plan with Kavi, or write my own"]
